  "solution": {
    "text": "When the key is at position (B) for a long time; the energy stored in the inductor is :<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>U</mtext> <mtext>B</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <msubsup> <mtext>Li</mtext> <mn>0</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msubsup> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>&#183;</mo> <mtext>L</mtext> <mo>&#183;</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>E</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>LE</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <msubsup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msubsup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0036_5ce795eaf12d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 183px; height: 148px;\" /><br /><br />This whole energy will be dissipated in the form of heat when the inductor is connected to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and no source is connected.<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0036_6208ccd40412.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 185px; height: 122px;\" />"
  }
